{{Passive skill box|Hollow Palm Technique}}

'''Hollow Palm Technique''' is a [[keystone passive skill]] which grants various bonuses while the player is [[Unencumbered]] (being [[Unarmed]] with no [[off-hand]] or [[glove]]s equipped).

==Mechanics==
While unencumbered, unarmed attacks count as [[Dual Wielding]], which also causes attacks to alternate between using the main hand and off hand (by default, unarmed attacks only count as main hand)<ref name="unarmed"/><ref name="hollowpalm_fixed"/>, though the animation may not indicate this.<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/pathofexile/comments/fnygra/comment/flcdq5l/</ref>

